.TH mdmc-list-drafts 1  "drafts " 
.SH NAME
mdmc\-list\-drafts \- List draft file paths
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmdmc list drafts\fR [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List draft file paths
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR
Path to config.toml (default ~/.config/mdmc/config.toml)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print a JSON array instead of plain paths
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
